### How to set locale for date-related components?

See [How to set locale for date-related components](https://ant.design/components/date-picker/#localization)

### Date-related components locale is not working?

See FAQ [Date-related-components-locale-is-not-working?](https://ant.design/docs/react/faq#date-related-components-locale-is-not-working)

### How to get date from panel click?

`onSelect` provide `info.source` to help on this:

```tsx
<Calendar
  onSelect={(date, { source }) => {
    if (source === 'date') {
      console.log('Panel Select:', source);
    }
  }}
/>
```
